            "ProductNarrativeDescription_s": "Enjoy the flexibility of a handshower that rinses, restores, and rejuvenates—all at the touch of a button. The KOHLER Statement multifunction handshower elevates your daily routine with a selection of three versatile spray options designed to provide a luxurious and invigorating experience. Immerse yourself in Full Coverage powered by Katalyst air-induction technology, which infuses water with air to create generously large, soft water drops that wrap you in tranquility. For a gentler yet equally indulgent escape, the silky Cloud spray offers supremely fine droplets that cascade over the skin like a soothing mist. When targeted relief is needed, the Deep Massage spray energizes sore muscles with powerful, kinetic cross-streams that revive and refresh. The multifunction oblong handshower is effortlessly elegant, featuring an intuitive mode selector button that puts control at your fingertips. Its sophisticated, minimalist design seamlessly complements a wide array of KOHLER faucets and accessories, making it a harmonious addition to both modern and classic spaces. Every detail is designed with functionality and aesthetic appeal in mind, ensuring that this handshower integrates beautifully into your bathroom while delivering exceptional performance tailored to your every need. With the Statement handshower, every shower becomes an opportunity to indulge in comfort, relaxation, and revitalization.",
